# SEJER, customer since 2016 #

SEJER, subsidiary of Editis group, is a publishing house which gather Nathan editions, Bordas, Le Robert, Clé international and Retz. Sejer develop a i-manuel.fr plateform which allows teachers to make books available to their students, either by physical way, either in their numerical version via a pupil licence.

IDCI consulting is a major actor in the evolution of this plateform. Indeed, the customer is mature on his needs but don't always have de needed ressources internally.

